16	/// `_deletePickedFile`/`_pick`'s own replace-on-fresh-pick cleanup are
17	/// both fire-and-forget (`unawaited`) by design — a single microtask
18	/// tick isn't a reliable enough wait for a real `dart:io` file-delete to
19	/// land under full-suite load, so assertions on the resulting file poll
20	/// instead, bounded to avoid hanging if the delete genuinely never
21	/// happens. Mirrors `audio_entry_cubit_test.dart`'s own helper.
22	Future<void> _waitUntilDeleted(File file) async {
23	  for (var i = 0; i < 50 && file.existsSync(); i++) {
24	    await Future<void>.delayed(const Duration(milliseconds: 10));
25	  }
26	}
